  s0: Old session and a queued input
  s1: Seed committed#59; gate holds it
  s2: Restart holds the transition and fence
  s3: Exact close confirmed#59; retire and settle
  s4: Old execution retired#59; exclusion still held
  s5: Exclusion released#59; reply pending
  s6: Owner turn began a launch
  s7: Seed waits for the owner
  s8: Owner turn installed Pending
  s9: Create answered#59; first input not submitted
  s10: Unknown create acknowledgement was replayed
  s11: Pending without a launching turn#59; an input waits
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Commit the seed original (acceptance)
  s1 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s2 --> s3: Close only the captured pane
  s3 --> s4: Retire CAS and settle the old turn
  s4 --> s5: Disconnect keeping selector, release, wake
  s5 --> s6: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s5 --> s7: Reply to the command
  s6 --> s8: Install Pending over the vacant row
  s6 --> s6: Reply to the command
  s7 --> s6: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s8 --> s9: Create the pane once
  s9 --> s10: Create again after an unknown reply
  s9 --> s5: Create unknown: keep Pending, fail visibly
  s5 --> s10: Create again after an unknown reply
  s5 --> s11: Reply to the command
  s9 --> s11: Create unknown: keep Pending, fail visibly
  s11 --> s10: Create again after an unknown reply
